<title>UK: Tate&amp;Lyle half year profit slumps.</title>
<headline>Tate&amp;Lyle half year profit slumps.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>26 weeks to March 29 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) diluted    4.5		    vs 23.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.3		    vs 5.3</p>
<p> Pretax preexcepts	113.6		  vs 168.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,292.4		vs 2,406.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 112.7 and 129 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Tate &amp; Lyle Plc</p>
